    {
      "name": "wire_size",
      "title": "Wire size calculator",
      "description": "Minimum conductor size for a circuit: NEC Table 310.16 ampacity at the termination temperature rating, the 240.4(D) small-conductor limits, voltage drop over the run, and the Table 250.122 equipment grounding conductor, increased in proportion under 250.122(B) when voltage drop upsizes the conductors.",
